WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.962
Watch and read: For your presentation practice, you are presenting on my family. What

00:00:04.962 --> 00:00:06.323
is the best answer?

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:11.915
The answer is: Face your audience. Read the instruction carefully and choose the

00:00:11.915 --> 00:00:13.365
helpful or correct response.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:19.118
Watch and read: Ama asks: Ama is giving a class talk. Which body-language choice

00:00:19.118 --> 00:00:19.469
helps?

00:00:20.283 --> 00:00:25.035
The answer is: face the listener. Friendly posture and gestures support

00:00:25.035 --> 00:00:25.467
communication.
